WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:03.360
Unit eighteen. Cultural Traditions!

2
00:00:04.325 --> 00:00:11.411
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level three!

3
00:00:11.461 --> 00:00:15.036
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:19.125
Today we learn: Cultural Traditions. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.871 --> 00:00:23.221
Tradition. Say it with me. Tradition!

6
00:00:26.727 --> 00:00:30.027
Custom. Say it with me. Custom!

7
00:00:33.541 --> 00:00:37.125
Heritage. Say it with me. Heritage!

8
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.300
Ceremony. Say it with me. Ceremony!

9
00:00:47.855 --> 00:00:51.722
Generation. Say it with me. Generation!

10
00:00:55.211 --> 00:00:58.944
Pass down. Say it with me. Pass down!

11
00:01:02.455 --> 00:01:06.505
Ancestor. Say it with me. Ancestor!

12
00:01:09.955 --> 00:01:13.205
Preserve. Say it with me. Preserve!

13
00:01:16.755 --> 00:01:26.313
Grammar time! Passive voice for traditions. Listen. This ceremony is passed down through generations.

14
00:01:26.363 --> 00:01:32.129
Your turn. Say it with me. This ceremony is passed down through generations.

15
00:01:37.205 --> 00:01:50.135
Cultural traditions and customs connect us to our heritage. Ceremonies are often passed down from one generation to the next, honoring our ancestors. Preserving these traditions keeps our culture alive.

16
00:01:50.185 --> 00:01:51.600
I like this story!

17
00:01:52.857 --> 00:01:58.078
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.128 --> 00:01:59.278
Heritage!

19
00:02:00.161 --> 00:02:05.358
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:05.408 --> 00:02:06.558
Ancestor!

21
00:02:07.653 --> 00:02:15.719
Think and answer. What is a tradition your family follows?

22
00:02:15.769 --> 00:02:16.919
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.144 --> 00:02:20.717
This unit's value is Cultural Pride.

24
00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:23.392
I can show cultural pride every day!

25
00:02:24.429 --> 00:02:28.739
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:28.789 --> 00:02:30.323
Bye-bye, friends!

